### Get Member Info - Currency

GET https://{{server}}/HyperionPlanning/rest/v3/applications/{{app}}/dimensions/Currency/members/Currency
Authorization: {{creds}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Member Info - From Currency

GET https://{{server}}/HyperionPlanning/rest/v3/applications/{{app}}/dimensions/From Currency/members/From Currency
Authorization: {{creds}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Member Info - From USD

GET https://{{server}}/HyperionPlanning/rest/v3/applications/{{app}}/dimensions/From Currency/members/From USD
Authorization: {{creds}}
Accept: application/json


### Get Member Info - Currency

GET https://{{server}}/HyperionPlanning/rest/v3/applications/{{app}}/dimensions/Account/members/FCCS_System Account
Authorization: {{creds}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Member Info - USD

GET https://{{server}}/HyperionPlanning/rest/v3/applications/{{app}}/dimensions/Currency/members/USD
